#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:1
#: a369c73de97d41f1a8afd09851ae9778
msgid "按晶格选择（Select by Lattice）"
msgstr "Select by Lattice"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:3
#: 679e95a31fb4446fa5b18928c35e2ace
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:5
#: a03c600693c4449d96ab65b715937d66
msgid "按照晶格长度 `a/b/c` 和晶格角 `α/β/γ` 选择结构。适合从混合数据中找特定尺寸、 体形或畸变范围的晶胞，不依赖当前散点图坐标。"
msgstr ""
"Select structures by lattice lengths `a/b/c` and angles `α/β/γ`. Use it "
"to find cells with a particular size, shape, or distortion range in mixed"
" data; the selection does not depend on the current scatter-plot axes."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:8
#: abdc38a4abab49f7a3a1e88a53f1d2ae
msgid "判定原理"
msgstr "Decision principle"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:10
#: d83ef9366d81431499d26adadcbbf101
msgid "对每个结构，程序从晶胞矩阵计算"
msgstr ""
"For each structure, the program computes the following values from the "
"cell matrix:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:12
#: ca08b5c1eeab4e1bb86f7e9a3fdbb73b
msgid ""
"\n"
"(a,b,c,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma),\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"(a,b,c,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma),\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:16
#: 9c306087461e4ec484183d51d8c452b3
msgid ""
"其中 $a,b,c$ 是三条晶格矢量长度，单位为 Å；$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma$ 分别是 $\\mathbf b$ 与 "
"$\\mathbf c$、$\\mathbf a$ 与 $\\mathbf c$、$\\mathbf a$ 与 $\\mathbf b$ "
"的夹角，单位为度。结构只有在六个量都落入各自闭区间时才会被选中："
msgstr ""
"Here $a,b,c$ are the three lattice-vector lengths in Å. "
"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma$ are respectively the angles between $\\mathbf b$"
" and $\\mathbf c$, $\\mathbf a$ and $\\mathbf c$, and $\\mathbf a$ and "
"$\\mathbf b$, in degrees. A structure is selected only when all six "
"quantities lie in their respective closed intervals:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:20
#: eff041528bcd48b3b0d29c241827bcd6
msgid ""
"\n"
"M(i)=\\bigwedge_{q\\in\\{a,b,c,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\}}\n"
"\\left(q_{\\min}-10^{-4}\\le q_i\\le q_{\\max}+10^{-4}\\right).\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"M(i)=\\bigwedge_{q\\in\\{a,b,c,\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\}}\n"
"\\left(q_{\\min}-10^{-4}\\le q_i\\le q_{\\max}+10^{-4}\\right).\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:25
#: 33addffa13744b01b8360aa7815c3a36
#, python-brace-format
msgid "固定的 $10^{-4}$ 容差用于吸收浮点换算误差，并不是可调的物理容差。若某一维不想参与筛选， 应把该维范围放宽到覆盖全部数据。"
msgstr ""
"The fixed $10^{-4}$ tolerance only absorbs floating-point conversion "
"error; it is not an adjustable physical tolerance. To exclude one "
"dimension from filtering, widen its range to cover all data."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:28
#: 6740d88e908846a8b461a92898856089
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5379
#: e6e2f4239b0640b39a4c78e82a4d36b1
msgid "输入控件：晶格长度 `a / b / c` 与晶格角 `α / β / γ` 各自的最小值和最大值。"
msgstr ""
"Controls: minimum and maximum values for lattice lengths `a / b / c` and "
"angles `α / β / γ`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5380
#: 07193392b85447b59d2e17d334e939cd
msgid "范围：`[0, 1e6]`，4 位小数。"
msgstr "Range: `[0, 1e6]`, with four decimal places."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5381
#: 6ee5a9c2573348808ba5bb598cd157dd
msgid "默认值：当前活动结构的晶格参数范围。"
msgstr "Defaults: the lattice-parameter ranges of the currently active structures."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5382
#: 03da76fca5bb41028c18ae73b1f1a21d
msgid "边界：比较时带 `1e-4` 的容差，恰好落在边界上的结构也会被选中。"
msgstr "Boundaries: comparisons use a `1e-4` tolerance, so structures exactly on a boundary are selected too."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:5384
#: 86d453e5f3e645079d01d7ec07f8b414
