#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:35
#: 67c0be25efb145ecbd8c0e70d452aa85
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-select-lattice.md:37
#: f59e3db7382f48a1a127b8f5a6b2da28
msgid "六组范围同时生效。若没有选中结果，先放宽不关心的晶格角或长度范围，再逐项收紧， 避免把无关维度设成过窄的过滤条件。"
msgstr ""
"All six ranges apply simultaneously. If nothing is selected, first widen "
"the length or angle ranges that are not relevant, then tighten the "
"intended dimensions one at a time."

#~ msgid "细节：内部比较带固定容差 `1e-4`。"
#~ msgstr "Detail: internal comparisons use a fixed `1e-4` tolerance."
